tton></div><div class=\"relative\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"data-menu\" class=\"flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-medium tracking-normal text-white/80 transition-colors duration-300 ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)]\">Request custom data <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><a class=\"shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap py-3 text-[13px] font-medium tracking-normal text-white/80 transition-colors duration-300 ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/gear\">Gadgets for capture</a><a class=\"shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap py-3 text-[13px] font-medium tracking-normal text-white/80 transition-colors duration-300 ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/agent-demo\">Agent demo</a><a class=\"shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap py-3 text-[13px] font-medium tracking-normal text-white/80 transition-colors duration-300 ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/blog\">Articles</a></div><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-6 sm:flex\"><a aria-label=\"Your orders\" class=\"relative grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white/75 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--primary)]/50 hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/orders\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path><path d=\"M20.27 18.27 22 20\"></path><path d=\"M21 10.498V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.729l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 .001l.98-.559\"></path><path d=\"M3.29 7 12 12l8.71-5\"></path><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 8.997 5.148\"></path><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"16.5\" r=\"2.5\"></circle></svg></a><a aria-label=\"Cart with 0 items\" class=\"relative grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 text-white/75 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--primary)]/50 hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" href=\"/checkout\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-bag\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"></path><path d=\"M3.103 6.034h17.794\"></path><path d=\"M3.4 5.467a2 2 0 0 0-.4 1.2V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6.667a2 2 0 0 0-.4-1.2l-2-2.667A2 2 0 0 0 17 2H7a2 2 0 0 0-1.6.8z\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-transparent px-3 text-[13px] font-medium tracking-normal text-white/75 transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/50 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-[var(--primary)]\">Sign in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)] px-5 text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-normal text-[var(--page-bg)] transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:opacity-90 hover:shadow-[0_10px_30px_-14px_var(--primary)]\">Join now</button></div><button aria-label=\"Open navigation\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 xl:hidden\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></nav></header><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[12px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--primary)] sm:text-[13px]\">Contributor program / How it works</p><h1 class=\"max-w-4xl font-heading text-[clamp(2.45rem,5vw,5.4rem)] font-medium leading-[.94] tracking-[-.045em] text-[var(--foreground)] mt-5\">Here’s how contributing to DigiRobotics works.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-[19px] leading-[1.5] text-[var(--muted-foreground)] lg:text-[21px]\">Three steps take you from registering a contributor profile to getting paid for approved capture tasks.</p></div><ol class=\"mt-14 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3\"><li class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/[.09] bg-[var(--surface)] p-7 transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/30\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] text-[var(--primary)]\">01</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-list text-white/45 transition-colors duration-300 ease-out group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"M12 11h4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16h4\"></path><path d=\"M8 11h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 16h.01\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"mt-12 font-heading text-2xl transition-colors duration-300 ease-out group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\">Register your profile</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[17px] leading-6 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">Create a contributor profile so you can be matched against upcoming campaigns and eligibility checks.</p></li><li class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/[.09] bg-[var(--surface)] p-7 transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/30\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] text-[var(--primary)]\">02</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-upload text-white/45 transition-colors duration-300 ease-out group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v12\"></path><path d=\"m17 8-5-5-5 5\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"mt-12 font-heading text-2xl transition-colors duration-300 ease-out group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\">Capture an approved task</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[17px] leading-6 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">When a campaign is assigned, record the requested first-person task with your phone or supported camera.</p></li><li class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/[.09] bg-[var(--surface)] p-7 transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--primary)]/30\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[12px] text-[var(--primary)]\">03</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wallet-cards text-white/45 transition-colors duration-300 ease-out group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 11h3.75a2 2 0 0 1 1.6.8l.45.6a4 4 0 0 0 6.4 0l.45-.6a2 2 0 0 1 1.6-.8H21\"></path><path d=\"M3 7h18\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><h2 class=\"mt-12 font-heading text-2xl transition-colors duration-300 ease-out group-hover:text-[var(--primary)]\">Submit and earn</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[17px] leading-6 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\">After review and acceptance, your contribution is paid in USDG.</p></li></ol><div class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--primary)]/25 bg-[var(--primary)]/[.05] p-6 sm:p-8\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[var(--primary)]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> Capture agent / Coming soon</p><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-[18px] leading-7 text-white/75\">The Telegram capture agent<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-medium text-white\">@DigiRoboticsCapture_bot</strong> <!-- -->will guide submissions once it is deployed. It is not active yet, so no video submission is required now.</p></div><div class=\"mt-9\"><a class=\"inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)] px-6 py-3 text-[15px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.04em] text-[var(--page-bg)] transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:opacity-90 hover:shadow-[0_10px_30px_-14px_var(--primary)] \" href=\"/gear\">Explore capture gear<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><footer class=\"border-t border-white/[.08] bg-[#111620] py-12\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-star